"A 3D escape-time formula with a numerical distance estimate: the shape works alone and combines with others; slower than analytic DE." = "采用数值距离估计的 3D 逃逸时间公式：形状可以单独成立，也能与其他公式组合；比解析 DE 慢。";
"A 3D escape-time formula with an analytic distance estimate: fast and robust; a good first formula." = "采用解析距离估计的 3D 逃逸时间公式：快而稳定；适合作为第一个公式。";
"A 4D formula with an analytic distance estimate: the 4D rotation applies, and it renders fast." = "采用解析距离估计的 4D 公式：4D 旋转起作用，而且渲染很快。";
"A 4D formula: the fourth coordinate and the 4D rotation of the Formulas window apply; numerical DE, so it is slow." = "4D 公式：第四坐标和公式窗口的 4D 旋转会起作用；数值 DE，所以较慢。";
"A 4d quaternion formula, one iteration:\n\nx' = x*x - y*y - z*z - w*w + Cx\ny' = 2*(y*x + z*w) + Cy\nz' = 2*(z*x + YW_multiplier*y*w) + Cz\nw' = 2*(w*x + y*z) + W_add + Cw" = "四维四元数公式，一次迭代：\n\nx' = x*x - y*y - z*z - w*w + Cx\ny' = 2*(y*x + z*w) + Cy\nz' = 2*(z*x + YW_multiplier*y*w) + Cz\nw' = 2*(w*x + y*z) + W_add + Cw";
"A Julia set takes this constant in place of each point's own." = "Julia 集用这个常数代替每个点自身的值。";
"A bulb formula as suggested by Aexion:\nhttp://www.fractalforums.com/the-3d-mandelbulb/iterating-c/\n\nAdded two options to power-rotate the Constant by the distance of the current vectors of Z and C (Cond Phi=1),\nand the following Mode options:\n(Bits of Mode value)\nBit1: Flip atan theta components\nBit2: Flip atan phi components\nBit3: Flip theta and phi\nBit4: Flip CyCz for angle calc\nBit5: Multiply powerC by the distance of vector Z and C" = "Aexion 建议的球茎（bulb）公式：\nhttp://www.fractalforums.com/the-3d-mandelbulb/iterating-c/\n\n新增两个选项，按 Z 与 C 当前向量之间的距离对常量做幂旋转 (Cond Phi=1)，\n以及以下模式选项：\n（模式值的各位）\nBit1：翻转 atan theta 分量\nBit2：翻转 atan phi 分量\nBit3：翻转 theta 和 phi\nBit4：计算角度时翻转 CyCz\nBit5：将 powerC 乘以向量 Z 与 C 的距离";
"A dIFS shape: a distance-estimated solid (sphere, box, tube ...). Combine it only with other dIFS formulas; mixing it with escape-time formulas gives the error 'formula option is not valid'." = "dIFS 形状：距离估计的实体（球、盒、管 ...）。只与其他 dIFS 公式组合；与逃逸时间公式混用会出现错误 'formula option is not valid'。";
"A dIFS transformation: it bends, repeats or cuts the dIFS shapes in the slots after it." = "dIFS 变换：弯曲、重复或切割其后槽位中的 dIFS 形状。";
"A hybrid of a sine power 2 bulb and the amazing box, the 3d vector length decides which formula is used:\nIf it is bigger than 'Box/Bulb R threshold' the amazing box is used, else if smaller than '..threshold 2' the sine bulb,\ninbetween both formulas will be interpolated.  Make the second threshold a little smaller than the first for more smoothness." = "2 次幂正弦球茎与神奇盒子（amazing box）的混合体，由三维向量的长度决定使用哪个公式：\n如果大于 'Box/Bulb R threshold'，使用神奇盒子；如果小于 '..threshold 2'，使用正弦球茎；\n两者之间则对两个公式进行插值。让第二个阈值比第一个略小，可使过渡更平滑。";
"A last pass over the picture." = "对图像进行的最后一道处理。";
"A panorama all around the camera, tagged so Facebook and photo apps show it as a 360° photo." = "环绕相机一周的全景图，并带有标记，Facebook 和照片应用会将其显示为 360° 照片。";
"A relief over the surface; its size in fractal units, about a twentieth of what the view shows." = "表面上的起伏；大小以分形单位计，约为视图所见范围的二十分之一。";
"A sine integer power bulb with foldings before, like in the amazing box." = "带有前置折叠的正弦整数幂球茎，与神奇盒子中的相同。";
"A transformation shows nothing alone: put a shape in slot 1 and this in slot 2, or the other way round." = "变换单独不显示任何东西：把形状放在槽位 1，把它放在槽位 2，或者反过来。";
"A transformation: it changes the point only and has no shape of its own. Use it in a slot before or between shaping formulas, never alone." = "变换：只改变点，本身没有形状。放在造型公式之前或之间的槽位中使用，不要单独使用。";
